<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Rabothytta from Leirskardalen — Leirbotnet–Rabothytta summer return</name><desc>From the summer parking at Leirbotnet, follow the gravel road to the marked path, ascend east of Mørkbekken and pass the north side of Mørkbekktjønna and Steinbua. Continue across the stream and the final rise to Rabothytta, then return along the same road and trail. Stop at the cabin; glacier travel is outside this variant.

